  "title": "Sidorenko's Conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture For any bipartite graph $H$ and graph $G$, the number of homomorphisms from $H$ to $G$ is at least $\\left(\\frac{2|E(G)|}{|V(G)|^2}\\right)^{|E(H)|}|V(G)|^{|V(H)|}$.",
